# Cursor Rules for AI Agent Setup Project

## Background Agent Configuration
- This project supports Cursor Background Agents
- Environment configuration is in `.cursor/environment.json`
- GitHub integration is required and configured
- Research agent can be started with `npm run dev`

## Research Agent Support
- Use WODA methodology for research questions
- Create structured research folders automatically
- Support both Python and Node.js implementations
- Enable agent-to-agent communication

## Development Workflow
- Use background agents for autonomous development tasks
- Maintain proper git workflow with branch management
- Enable Privacy Mode for sensitive projects
- Monitor agent performance and resource usage

## File Organization
- Research topics in `research/` directory
- Agent implementations in `agents/` directory
- Gateway and communication in `gateway/` directory
- Tests in `tests/` directory

## Security and Privacy
- Enable Privacy Mode when working with sensitive code
- Use environment variables for configuration
- Follow security best practices for agent deployment
- Monitor and audit agent activities
